{"id":"memorial_105004","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial105000","label":"Data · I Don't Just Tell Anyone.wav"},"label":"Keen Eye Is a Must.wav","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_105003","next":null,"speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_105004_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"Hmm, I think I've covered everything..."},{"id":"memorial_105004_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"What else... Ah!"},{"id":"memorial_105004_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"Almost forgot the most important thing."},{"id":"memorial_105004_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"Do you know the one thing you absolutely need to survive in the Outer Rim?"},{"id":"memorial_105004_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"Oh, nailed it on the first try?"},{"id":"memorial_105004_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"That's right. You need a sharp eye. You're pretty smart, huh?"},{"id":"memorial_105004_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"So don't wander around like it says \"newbie\" on your forehead. Keep your eyes sharp, got it?"},{"id":"memorial_105004_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"Haha, quick on the uptake, aren't you?"},{"id":"memorial_105004_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"Well, then..."},{"id":"memorial_105004_10","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"Hmm? Wondering why I'm holding out my hand?"},{"id":"memorial_105004_11","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"Nothing's free around here. If you enjoyed my little speech, you gotta pay up."},{"id":"memorial_105004_12","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"I never said that?"},{"id":"memorial_105004_13","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"Really? I don't remember..."},{"id":"memorial_105004_14","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"Huh?"},{"id":"memorial_105004_15","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"You recorded it?"},{"id":"memorial_105004_16","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"Oh? Really now?"},{"id":"memorial_105004_17","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"(Sound of something being stabbed)"},{"id":"memorial_105004_18","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"See? That's why I said keep your eyes sharp."},{"id":"memorial_105004_19","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"Haha, thought you were smart, but I guess not."},{"id":"memorial_105004_20","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_50_04_description","text":"I'll take my due myself."}]}